  (text "PC817 24 V input test bench - 2 channels - Arduino UNO R4" (at 25.4 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 574f00aa-3e00-5798-9307-7f8b84a3b19c))
  (text "If = (24 V - 1.2 V opto - 2.0 V LED) / 4.4 k = 4.7 mA.  Each 2.2 k (1/4 W): 49 mW at 24 V, 75 mW at 28.8 V." (at 25.4 38.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid c3ff592a-9808-5fd8-9ff6-a392625bf8e1))
  (text "1N4148 protects both LEDs against a reversed input (PC817 VR max = 6 V)." (at 25.4 41.91 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 9ed1cab5-95aa-55ce-86d1-0d4786418cff))
  (text "GND_24V and GND are NOT connected: this is the isolation barrier." (at 25.4 45.72 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 60d7577a-c9b8-508c-8eaf-eca5eceb2d87))
